{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028114001:1":{"text":"방금 기억속의 허니리프베어가 전에 우리가 묻은 그 곰인가요...!","source_cn":"难道说，刚才回忆里那只叶角熊，是我们之前埋葬的那只叶角...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAD714CAE728E7B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028114002:0":{"text":"...네. 그건... 이르군, 제 첫 번째 친구였어요.","source_cn":"……是的。它……伊尔贡，是我的第一个朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33146AE71948BF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028114003:0":{"text":"다정하고, 푹신푹신하고, 조금 어수룩하지만 아주 용감한 친구였어요. 꿀 먹는 걸 제일 좋아했고, 특히 저를 믿었죠...","source_cn":"它很温柔，毛绒绒的，有一点点憨厚，可是很勇敢，最喜欢吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A5C2BC7F5B8C4FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028114004:0":{"text":"하지만 이번에는 제때 치료하지 못했어요... 저는...","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028114004":{"text":"하지만 이번에는 제때 치료하지 못했어요... 저는...","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028114007:1":{"text":"휴윈 양, 이르군은 기억 속에서 영원히 함께할 거예요.","source_cn":"伊温小姐，它永远都会在你的记忆里陪着你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B73E3AF0C6A060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028114008:1":{"text":"어느날 갑자기 마음 한켠이 따뜻해진다면, 어쩌면 이르군이 안아준 걸지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"要是你哪天突然感到心头一甜，没准就是它在请你吃蜂蜜呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC125D2E74BBF5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028114009:0":{"text":"위로해줘서 고마워요, 슬픔에서 천천히 벗어나 볼게요...","source_cn":"谢谢你们的安慰，我会慢慢走出悲伤的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F706ABC26839092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028114010:0":{"text":"제 힘도 회복되고 있으니, 마지막 흩어진 마력도 잘 회수했으면 좋겠어요...","source_cn":"我的力量也开始恢复了，希望能顺利回收最后一处散逸的魔力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB4B227EA3F4A9CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028114011:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 이번에는 어떤 아이템이 있어야 기억의 조각을 활성화할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"伊温小姐，这次需要什么样的物品来激活记忆碎片呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9506BC13DC1A53B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028114012:1":{"text":"음, 은방울꽃이 한 송이 필요할 거 같아요... 어디서 구할 수 있는지는 제가 알아요.","source_cn":"嗯，我想，需要一朵铃兰……我知道该去哪里找它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x448FBA5048A1E965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"(말없이 옆에 있어 준다)","source_cn":"（不说话，默默陪伴）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A8F81517A23A18","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(말없이 옆에 있어 준다)","female":"(말없이 옆에 있어 준다)","variant_male_record_index":"61666","variant_female_record_index":"61667","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028114005:0":{"text":"이르군, 너무 보고 싶어...","source_cn":"伊尔贡，我很想你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CFAEACA9D55A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028114006:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요, 감정을 잘 추스를게요.","source_cn":"别担心，我会努力调整好情绪的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5B0AFDD3184E350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"진정해, 마력이 흐트러지고 있어","source_cn":"冷静，你的魔力开始紊乱了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCEE3E669CEBAD15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"진정해, 마력이 흐트러지고 있어","female":"진정해, 마력이 흐트러지고 있어","variant_male_record_index":"61668","variant_female_record_index":"61669","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female